  "verseCount": 46,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1KI 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elicha ne bang'oosi ba Baali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyuma we siise sileeyi, elomo eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi yecha khu Elicha, mu mwiiko kukhola khataru efula ne akhakwa tawe eli, “Cha weyokesiane khu mwami Ahabu, mala ndalekhuula efula ekwe khu sibala.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono Elicha acha khukhwiyokesia khu Ahabu. Nono enjala mu Samaria yaba endafu lukali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu alaanga Obadia, owaba omwimeelesi owe lichipi. (Nono Obadia aba aria Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi lukali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nga Yesebeli eraanga bang'oosi ba Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Obadia abukula emia ndala khu nibo, mala abakisa mu mabina kabili, buli mu libina babaandu kamakhumi karaano. Mala abaechanga siakhulia ne kameechi.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu aboolela Obadia ali, “Cha okeende buli abuundu niio esebele eli nende buli mu matooma mwosi mu sibala. Wakana khunyala khwanyoola bunyaasi bunyala bwaliinda chifarasi ne chinyumbu chikhafwa tawe. Nio khukhakhola khurio khwatibia busa bibiaayo biefwe tawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bafukiilisiana lubeka lwe sibala nilwo buli mulala acha khulambuula. Ahabu acha lubeka lulala yeng'ene ne Obadia yesi acha lubeka luluundi yeng'ene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga Obadia ne aba khu lukeendo lwewe, Elicha amwakaanana. Obadia amumanya, mala amwinamila amureeba ali, “Ewe niwe omwami wase Elicha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akobosia ali, “Yee, ese niise. Cha oboolele omukhulu wowo, oli, ‘Elicha ali ano.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obadia amukobosia ali, “Bumayaanu siina nibwo ekholile nio unde mu mukhono kwo mwami Ahabu anjire? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wowo ne amenya, mbao sibala namwe bubwami niio omwami wase akhaarumania bakhuyiime tawe. Ne omwami yesi yesi ne aloma ali se oli mu sibala siewe tawe, Ahabu amurakho ne echuba ali se oliyo tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono ewe wenya ese nje mboolele omwami wase ndi ewe oli ano? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Roho owa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi akhola ario akhusuta akhuyila abuundu aandi ese ne njiile busa ndi. Ekhola ndio nacha naboolela omwami Ahabu ndi oli ano mala eche alekhe khukhunyoolao tawe. Aba alanjira. Khebulila oli ese naria Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi khukhwama mu bwana bwase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Se waulila niko nakhola nga Yesebeli ne eera bang'oosi ba Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi tawe? Nakisa bang'oosi emia ndala mu mabina mu bipupu bibili bie babaandu kamakhumi karaano nabalisia kimikaati ne kameechi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono onyala oriena wandaka oli nje mala mboolele omwami ndi ewe oli ano? Alanjira!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elicha amukobosia ali, “Nga Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi owe banamae ne amenya, niye ese ekholelaanga, khulaka ndi samwene ndeyekesiana ebweeni wo mwami endaalo yino.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Obadia acha khu mwami Ahabu mala amuboolela. Ahabu arekukha acha khukhwakaanana Elicha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga Ahabu ne abona Elicha aloma ali, “Ewe niwe onaania Isiraeli!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elicha amukobosia ali, “Ese se nananiisie Isiraeli tawe. Ewe ne enju eya paapa wowo ninywe munaniisie, sikila mwalekhile kamalaka ka Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi mala mwaloondile khu Baali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono rumania balaange babaandu ba Isiraeli boosi beche khwise a Sikulu sie Karimeli. Yiicha ne bang'oosi chimia chine ne kamakhumi karaano ba Baali, ne bang'oosi chimia chine ba Ashera, balia khu siaalwa sia Yesebeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Ahabu arumania alaanga Baisiraeli boosi, ne bang'oosi ba Baali a Sikulu sia Karimeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elicha acha embi niio babaandu boosi bali mala aloma ali, “Mulachiililila khuba ne kamebaasio kabili khu siise sina? Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aaba ne ali Wele, muloondekho ne Baali aaba ne ali wele, muloondekho.” Ne babaandu basila busa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Elicha aboolela babaandu ali, “Ese, seng'ene omung'oosi owa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi oramire ne bang'oosi ba Baali bali chimia chine ne kamakhumi karaano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khuelesie chiuunwa chibili. Lekha bang'oosi ba Baali barobore ndala bakiire bakitonyake mu bitonyi mala bakire khukhu. Ne bakhabwaana kumulilo tawe. Ese sesi ndakhola ndio ne uunwa ekiindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono bang'oosi ba Baali basabe wele waabwe ne ese ndasaba Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Ne wele olakobosia ne kumulilo, omwene oyo aba niye Wele.” Babaandu baloma bali, “Walomile bulayi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Elicha aboolela bang'oosi ba Baali ali, “Yiroborera euunwa ndala mala munyoe mukitonyake sikila enywe muli bakali. Musabe wele wenywe. Ne kakhali mukhara kumulilo mu khu tawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babukula euunwa niyo babaelesia mala bakitonyaka, mala basaba Baali khukhwama kumutikhinyi khukhwola nga ne liaanga. Baloma bali, “Ee Baali khukobosie!” Ne kakhali sisiindu se siauliilikhanakho tawe. Ne mbao owakobosia tawe. Babotookhelela alutare niyo baba ne bakholile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oli liaanga, Elicha arakikha khubakholela siienyameno ali, “Saba lukali, sikila ali wele. Wakana alikho aroora kumuusi namwe achiile khwiyeeta, namwe wakana akeniiye! Namwe alikho akona, mala mukhoya mumwinyosie!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio basaba lukali ne bekhalakaka ne kimibano ne chimbeko khuloondekhana ne kimiima kiabwe khukhwola nga bebeena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga enyanga ne yabira liaanga, bachiililila khukhola bario khukhwola nga siise sie embosio eye ekolooba siola. Ne kakhali sisiindu se siauliilikhanakho namwe omundu akobosia namwe aulila lisaba tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Elicha aboolela babaandu boosi ali, “Njisendeo siimbi.” Mala boosi bamwibuusiao. Arakikha khung'oona alutare eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi eyaba ne yatechukhaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.32.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lir. 32.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.35.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "35.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Elicha abukula kamabaale ekhumi na kabili, khuloondekhana ne chikholo ekhumi ne chibili che babaana ba Yakobo. Elomo eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi yaba yecha khu Yakobo eli alilaangwa bali Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kamabaale ako ombakhila alutare khu lisina lia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Ayaba kumuliinda abotookhelesia alutare. Kumuliinda kuno yaba kunyala kwechulamo bumiicho embi sikono silala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio ara chiikhu khu alutare, atonyaka euunwa mu bitonyi, mala akira khu khu. Aloma ali, “Yichusia chinyuungu chine kameechi mala mukachukhe khu siianwa sie khukhwosia ne khukhu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aloma lundi ali, “Chukhakho lukhola khabili.” Mala bakhola bario. Aloma ali, “Chukhakho lukhola khataru.” Mala bakhola bario lukhola khataru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kameechi katima keekha kabotookhelela alutare mala kechula mu muliinda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oli siise sie khuaana embosio eye ekolooba, omung'oosi Elicha eseenda a alutare mala asaba ali, “Ee, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Aburahamu, Isaaka ne Yakobo lekha luno limanyikhane endaalo yino lili ewewe oli Wele mu Isiraeli ne ese ndi omukholi wowo. Mala lundi lili ese nakholile bibiindu bino bioosi khulwe elomo yowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngobosie, Ee Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, ngobosie nio babaandu bano bamanye bali, Ewe oli Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, oli Wele, mala ewe wayuusiisie kimiooyo kiabwe kikhukobolele.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio kumulilo kwa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi kwosia embosio eye khukhwosia, chiikhu, ne kamabaale. Kwosia akhaba ne liloba mala kameechi kateenya kakaba mu muliinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga babaandu boosi ne babona lino, bakwa mafuumala mala baloma bali, “Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ali Wele, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ali Wele.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Elicha aloma ali, “Amba bang'oosi ba Baali, mukhalekhakho akhaba mulala khu nibo elukha tawe.” Babaandu babaamba boosi mala Elicha abekhisia khu kheechi kha Kishoni mala abeererayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Siimiyu siawa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Elicha aboolela omwami Ahabu ali, “Cha olie lundi onywe, sikila efula engali elikho eoloola, yolile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JAS.5.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yak. 5.18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nio Ahabu acha alia mala anywa. Elicha aniina khu ngaaki khwe sikulu sia Karimeli. Ebweeneyo enama asi kumurwe kwola akari we kamasikamo keewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aboolela omukholi wewe ali, “Niina angaaki olole sia nyanja.” Omukholi aniina, akobola mala aloma ali, “Se nabooneyo sisiindu tawe.” Elicha aloma ali, “Cha lundi khukhwola saba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne lukhola saba aloma ali, “Naboone lileesi litiiti liri, lili nga kumukhono kwo mundu, lienyookhe khukhwama mu nyanja.” Elicha aboolela omukholi ali, “Cha khu mwami Ahabu mala omuboolele engile mu likaari liewe lie liie mala ekhe akobole engo. Efula ekhamwiyikamia ano tawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu siise sitiiti, kamafuumbi kamamali kafuunikha mungaaki. Ekhuungu yarakikha khuucha mala efula engali yarakikha khukwa. Ahabu engila mu likaari liewe lie liie acha e Yesireeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kamaani ka Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi kaba khu Elicha eboela chingubo chewe mu sibuno, mala atima chimbilo arangirira Ahabu lukeendo lwosi khukhwola a silibwa e Yesireeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
